---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Passkey Developer Tools
description: A collection of developer tools for passkeys and WebAuthn!
---
<div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="text-center mt-2 mb-5 pt-0">
        <p class="lead text-body-secondary mt-3">Tools for building and debugging passkeys & WebAuthn
        </p>
        <p>Want to learn more about deploying passkeys?<br />
            <span class="fs-5">Check out <a href="https://passkeys.dev/">passkeys.dev</a></span>
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center pb-5">
        <!-- Feature Detect Tool -->
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4">
            <a href="/featuredetect/"
                class="card h-100 shadow border-0 hover-lift rounded-4 text-decoration-none bg-body-tertiary">
                <div class="card-body p-5 d-flex flex-column text-center">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="display-4"><i class="bi bi-search text-body"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3 text-body">Feature Detection</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-body flex-grow-1 lead fs-6">
                        Test your browser's WebAuthn capabilities for passkeys.
                        This also serves as a demo for the new getClientCapabilities() method!
                    </p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Origins Validator -->
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4">
            <a href="/relatedorigins/"
                class="card h-100 shadow border-0 hover-lift rounded-4 text-decoration-none bg-body-tertiary">
                <div class="card-body p-5 d-flex flex-column text-center">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="display-4"><i class="bi bi-braces text-body"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3 text-body">Related Origins Validator</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-body flex-grow-1 lead fs-6">
                        Validate and test your Related Origin Requests configuration against the specification
                        or just try things out as part of planning a deployment!
                    </p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Response Decoder -->
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4">
            <a href="/responsedecoder/"
                class="card h-100 shadow border-0 hover-lift rounded-4 text-decoration-none bg-body-tertiary">
                <div class="card-body p-5 d-flex flex-column text-center">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="display-4"><i class="bi bi-filetype-json text-body"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3 text-body">Response Decoder</h2>
                    <p class="card-text text-body flex-grow-1 lead fs-6">
                        Get a human-readable view into WebAuthn registration and authentication responses.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-3 mb-3">
        Feedback? Want to see another tool?
        <p class="mb-0 fs-4">
            <a href="mailto:tools@passkeys.dev"><i class="bi bi-envelope-at-fill me-2"></i></a>
            <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/passkeys.dev" target="_blank"><i
                    class="bi bi-bluesky me-2"></i></a>
            <a href="https://fosstodon.org/@passkeysdev" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-mastodon"></i></a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
